LibiaoLink selectively adapts the A-type dash fitting and complex linetype
placement rules documented and implemented by truedxf. It does not bundle the
truedxf parser, renderer, application, fonts, or runtime dependencies.

Pinned upstream: https://github.com/tth05/truedxf
Commit: 019c2e504738965c17818a5780097fef0e7a52f4
Sources: packages/geometry/src/dash.ts;
packages/render/src/draw/complex-linetype.ts;
research/notes/06-hatch-linetype-appearance.md (sections 2.2, 2.3, 2.6.1).
Local adaptation: unified/dxf_linetype.py. Geometry, budgets, source references,
uploaded font resolution and inherited representation selection use LibiaoLink's
existing UCD contracts. Community CAD probes are upstream evidence; the local
synthetic/browser regressions are not independent AutoCAD acceptance.

