Additional selective adaptation: packages/render/src/draw/acis.ts (explicit
planar boundary curve interpretation), packages/plot/src/pen-linetype.ts and
fill-style.ts (paper-unit pen patterns and device-pixel fill tiles), and
packages/render/src/draw/underlay.ts (HLS contrast/fade/monochrome display fit).
The adapter preserves source identities, budgets and upload-only resolution;
no permissive chord/control-polygon, unsupported placeholder or mean-vertex
color fallback is taken from the community previews.
